---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Page not found | MathMyRate" description="That page does not exist. Here is what does." noindex={true}>
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">404</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 text-5xl font-bold leading-none md:text-6xl">That page moved, or never lived here.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">The address may be mistyped, or the page may have been renamed while the site grew. Everything useful is one of these:</p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><h2 class="display text-xl font-bold">All calculators</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/65">Start from the home page and pick a tool.</p><span class="mt-6 block font-semibold text-navy">Go home →</span></a>
      <a href="/freelance/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><h2 class="display text-xl font-bold">Freelance pricing</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/65">Hourly and day rates, and project quotes.</p><span class="mt-6 block font-semibold text-navy">Open hub →</span></a>
      <a href="/fees/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><h2 class="display text-xl font-bold">Platform fees</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/65">Stripe, PayPal, Gumroad, and Lemon Squeezy.</p><span class="mt-6 block font-semibold text-navy">Open hub →</span></a>
      <a href="/methodology/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><h2 class="display text-xl font-bold">Methodology</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/65">How the numbers are calculated and sourced.</p><span class="mt-6 block font-semibold text-navy">Read how →</span></a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
